[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12301.349, "timestamp": "03:25:01", "text": "ええ、長い間そこには行ってないんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12303.269, "timestamp": "03:25:03", "text": "しかし、私がそれをした時には、それは最初の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12306.389, "timestamp": "03:25:06", "text": "私が気づくこと。言った通りだよ、君"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12308.469, "timestamp": "03:25:08", "text": "あなたは自分の仕事にとても長けていますね。おお、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12308.902, "timestamp": "03:25:08", "author": "@senpainotfoundd", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MxpRBxfrp903U81_WAr-BZO6QKwdKT1rJjdvDSuF8Nu_JP9JTpQCOA_SSgLjCV10OU4M-cDGhyk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i think there are some sort of softwares that auto clip the stream moments, if that helps"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12310.71, "timestamp": "03:25:10", "text": "うん。まず最初に、もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12313.349, "timestamp": "03:25:13", "text": "ジョーの持ち物をチェックしてください。すべては"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12315.75, "timestamp": "03:25:15", "text": "説明。ぜひこれを応援してください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12317.83, "timestamp": "03:25:17", "text": "男。彼は本当に優秀だ。彼は本当に親切だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12319.83, "timestamp": "03:25:19", "text": "よし、彼と楽しい時間を過ごして。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12322.79, "timestamp": "03:25:22", "text": "Helioを応援しよう。 Helioを購読しましょう。彼"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12323.138, "timestamp": "03:25:23", "author": "@senpainotfoundd", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MxpRBxfrp903U81_WAr-BZO6QKwdKT1rJjdvDSuF8Nu_JP9JTpQCOA_SSgLjCV10OU4M-cDGhyk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "maybe it is or maybe not i forgot"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12325.429, "timestamp": "03:25:25", "text": "当然の報いだ。聞いて、聞いて。しないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12327.11, "timestamp": "03:25:27", "text": "私をフォローする必要があります。必要ない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12329.75, "timestamp": "03:25:29", "text": "私のような。私のを彼にあげて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12332.71, "timestamp": "03:25:32", "text": "彼が必要とする時はいつでも支えてあげてください。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12334.55, "timestamp": "03:25:34", "text": "ええ、そういうことです。よし、終わりにしよう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12336.71, "timestamp": "03:25:36", "text": "その部分に戻って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12339.429, "timestamp": "03:25:39", "text": "別のセグメント。よし。わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12341.91, "timestamp": "03:25:41", "text": "ジョス、セグメント名を挙げてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12344.229, "timestamp": "03:25:44", "text": "H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12345.83, "timestamp": "03:25:45", "text": "何もない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12353.03, "timestamp": "03:25:53", "text": "それは全てに関わることだよ。厳しい努力、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12354.87, "timestamp": "03:25:54", "text": "大変な仕事だ。あなたは自分のことをよく知っている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12358.469, "timestamp": "03:25:58", "text": "努力だけをしないという意味ではないと言った"}]